:: Cellar Stairs [room: stairs, scene]
// <- punctuation.definition.heading.weft
// ^^^^^^^^^^^^^ entity.name.section.weft
//                ^^^^ entity.other.attribute-name.weft
//                      ^^^^^^ string.unquoted.weft
//                              ^^^^^ entity.other.attribute-name.weft
{on enter: lamp.oil -= 1}
// <- punctuation.section.braces.begin.weft
//^^^^^^^ keyword.control.directive.weft
//         ^^^^ meta.embedded.weft source.ts.embedded.weft
//                      ^ punctuation.section.braces.end.weft
The lamp is {lamp.lit ? "lit" : "dark"}, in no time, if ever.
//          ^ punctuation.section.braces.begin.weft
//           ^^^^^^^^ source.ts.embedded.weft
//                                    ^ punctuation.section.braces.end.weft
//                                       ^^ - keyword
//                                                   ^^ - keyword
It has *some* oil and **no** wick. \{Really\}
//     ^^^^^^ markup.italic.weft
//                    ^^^^^^ markup.bold.weft
//                                 ^^ constant.character.escape.weft
/* A note. */ See http://example.com.
// <- comment.block.weft
//^^^^^^^^^^^ comment.block.weft
//                     ^^^^^^^^^ - comment
  // A line comment.
//^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ comment.line.double-slash.weft
{if lamp.lit}Bright.{else}Dark.{/if}
//^ keyword.control.directive.weft
//                   ^^^^ keyword.control.directive.weft
//                              ^^^ keyword.control.directive.weft
[[Go down -> Cellar]]{when lamp.lit, reason: "Too dark."}
// <- punctuation.definition.link.begin.weft
//^^^^^^^ string.other.link.title.weft
//        ^^ keyword.operator.arrow.weft
//           ^^^^^^ entity.name.label.passage.weft
//                    ^^^^ keyword.control.directive.weft
//                         ^^^^^^^^ source.ts.embedded.weft
Back to the [[Hall]].
//            ^^^^ entity.name.label.passage.weft
{continue -> Platform, label: "Begin"}
//^^^^^^^ keyword.control.directive.weft
//        ^^ keyword.operator.arrow.weft
